@[expose] public section

/- Lemma 10.70.6 (Stacks tag `0G8S`): if
`I = (a₁, ..., aᵣ₊₁)`, then the quotient
`R[x₂, ..., xᵣ₊₁] / (a₁ xᵢ - aᵢ₊₁)` maps surjectively to `R[I / a₁]`, and
its kernel is both the `a₁`-power-torsion ideal and the primary component of
the principal ideal generated by `a₁`. -/

